category: Libs
requires: cygwin libgcc1 libgmp10 libgomp1
sdesc: "Modern cryptographic meta-toolkit (runtime)"
ldesc: "RELIC is a modern cryptographic meta-toolkit with emphasis on efficiency and
flexibility. RELIC can be used to build efficient and usable cryptographic
toolkits tailored for specific security levels and algorithmic choices."
external-source: relic-toolkit

